HEADS A

START * CHECK * R
CHECK = CHECK * D
CHECK _ BACKU * R
CHECK | SHORTBACK * U

BACKU * BACK * U
BACK ! BACK * U
BACK _ CHECK * D

SHORTBACK ! SHORTBACK * U
SHORTBACK _ SET * D

SET ! SET F D
SET _ CLEARBACK * U

CLEARBACK ! CLEARBACK * U
CLEARBACK _ RIGHT * D


RIGHT ! REMOVE * R
RIGHT _ FINISH * U

REMOVE ! REMOVE _ R
REMOVE _ LEFT * L

LEFT F RIGHT * D
LEFT _ LEFT * L

FINISH ! FINISH | U
FINISH _ STOP * S

